<title>ARGENTINA: ARGENTINE DOMESTIC OILSEED/WHEAT INDUSTRY SNAPSHOT.</title>
<headline>ARGENTINE DOMESTIC OILSEED/WHEAT INDUSTRY SNAPSHOT.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimates, to July 9, of total 1996/97 purchases by Argentine oilseed crushers and wheat millers in the indicated crop year (thousands of tonnes):</p>
<p> Bread Wheat	  3,872.8</p>
<p> Soybeans	     6,205.7</p>
<p> Sunseeds	     4,583.3</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
